# graphify — knowledge-graph output. Nothing here is committed.
#
# graphify's docs recommend committing graphify-out/ so a team shares one map.
# We deliberately don't: it grows ~60 KB of packed history per code-touching
# commit (~10 MB/month at this repo's rate, against a 23 MB history), the
# dated backup directories graphify writes (e.g. graphify-out/2026-09-07/) are
# ~17 MB each, and rebuilding is free, offline and takes ~45s.
#
# Build it after cloning with:  mise run graph:build
graphify-out/
